Scheduler v2: results for the release meeting.
In 20 trials of our benchmark, the median time of v1 divided by the median time of v2 was 1.13 [R2].
Version 2 was quicker in 15 of 20 paired trials [R2].
Both versions had occasional slow trials caused by other work on the shared machine, and the slowest v2 trial was slower than the median v1 trial [R2].
We have not measured deadline misses on a robot, so this report makes no claim about them.
We did not measure CPU use.
We recommend one supervised trial on one robot before any wider roll-out.
